msgid "The fabric inventory could not be read. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Uluhlu lwefabric alukwazanga ukufundwa. Jonga ilogi yeCacti."

#: lib/InventoryPage.php
msgid "Transmit wait counts ticks in which a port had data to send but could not send it, for lack of credits or arbitration. A high value shows congestion toward the remote end; it does not show that the port or its cable is faulty. The tick length is not published for current link speeds, so values are ticks per second, not time."
msgstr "Ukulinda ukuthumela kubala iitick apho iport ibinedatha yokuthumela kodwa ayikwazanga ukuyithumela, ngenxa yokunqongophala kweekredithi okanye ulamlo. Ixabiso eliphezulu libonisa uxinaniso oluya kwisiphelo esikude; alibonisi ukuba iport okanye intambo yayo inengxaki. Ubude be-tick abupapashwanga kwisantya sangoku soqhagamshelo, ngoko ke amaxabiso ziitick ngomzuzwana, hayi ixesha."

