#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "The sweep runs as root. Run the poller as an unprivileged account with read access to the umad devices through a group."
msgstr "Uhlolo lusebenza njengo-root. Sebenzisa i-poller njengeakhawunti engenamalungelo aphezulu enemvume yokufunda izixhobo ze-umad ngeqela."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool has the setuid or setgid bit. The plugin never needs it."
msgstr "Isixhobo soxilongo sinebhithi ye-setuid okanye ye-setgid. Iplagini ayize iyifune."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool or its directory can be written by an account other than its owner, or by the poller account. Whoever can write it chooses what the poller runs."
msgstr "Isixhobo soxilongo okanye uvimba waso unokubhalwa yiakhawunti engeyiyo umnini waso, okanye yiakhawunti ye-poller. Nabani na onokubhala kuso ukhetha into eza kuqhutywa yi-poller."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "A umad device is readable or writable by every account, so any local user can query the fabric. Restrict it to a group."
msgstr "Isixhobo se-umad sifundeka okanye sibhaleka yiyo yonke iakhawunti, ngoko ke nawuphi na umsebenzisi walapha unokubuza ifabrikhi. Sithintele kwiqela."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "Unknown warning"
msgstr "Isilumkiso esingaziwayo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Diagnostics Tools"
msgstr "Izixhobo zoXilongo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directory, on each poller that sweeps a fabric, holding perfquery, ibnetdiscover, and iblinkinfo. The Debian and Ubuntu packages install them in /usr/sbin. No other program is ever run from it."
msgstr "Uvimba opheleleyo, kwi-poller nganye ehlola ifabrikhi, ogcina i-perfquery, i-ibnetdiscover, kunye ne-iblinkinfo. Iipakethe ze-Debian kunye ne-Ubuntu zizifaka kwindlela /usr/sbin. Akukho nanye inkqubo eqhutywa kuyo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Tool Directory"
msgstr "Uvimba weZixhobo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Name Map"
msgstr "Imephu yaMagama eeNodi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional absolute path to an infiniband-diags node name map file. Names it supplies are shown only; identity is always the node GUID."
msgstr "Indlela epheleleyo yokuzikhethela eya kwifayile yemephu yamagama eenodi ye-infiniband-diags. Amagama ewabonelelayo ayaboniswa kuphela; uphawu lwenodi luhlala luyi-GUID yenodi."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Datagram Timeout"
msgstr "Ixesha loKuphelelwa kweDatagram"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Milliseconds each management datagram may take before the tools retry it (their -t option)."
msgstr "Ii-millisecond ezinokuthathwa yidatagram nganye yolawulo ngaphambi kokuba izixhobo zizame kwakhona (ukhetho lwazo: -t)."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Timeout"
msgstr "Ixesha loKuphelelwa koMyalelo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one tool run may take before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Imizuzwana enokuthathwa luqhutywo lwesixhobo esinye ngaphambi kokuba lumiswe kwaye lurekhodwe njengolusileleyo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one tool run may print. Larger output is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "I-KiB enokuprintwa luqhutywo lwesixhobo esinye. Iziphumo ezinkulu ziyalahlwa kwaye zirekhodwe njengezisileleyo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Output"
msgstr "Iziphumo eziPhezulu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Sweep"
msgstr "Uhlolo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Time Budget"
msgstr "Uhlahlo-lwabiwo lweXesha leNodi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node sweep may spend reading counters. Ports not reached are read in the next cycle."
msgstr "Imizuzwana uhlolo lwenodi enye olungayichitha lufunda izibali. Amazibuko angafikelelwanga afundwa kumjikelo olandelayo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Failed ports after which a node sweep stops for this cycle. A port that does not answer costs several seconds."
msgstr "Amazibuko asileleyo ekuthi emva kwawo uhlolo lwenodi lume kulo mjikelo. Izibuko elingaphenduliyo lidla imizuzwana eliqela."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Failure Budget"
msgstr "Uhlahlo-lwabiwo loKusilela kweNodi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Index Down Ports"
msgstr "Faka kwi-Index amaZibuko aPhantsi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, the Fabric Port data query also lists ports that are down and have no remote end, such as unused adapter ports. Cleared, they are left out until they come up."
msgstr "Xa ikhethiwe, umbuzo wedatha ye-Fabric Port udwelisa namazibuko aphantsi okanye angafikelelekiyo kwaye angenasiphelo esikude, njengamazibuko eadaptha angasetyenziswayo. Xa ingakhethwanga, ayashiywa de abe phezulu."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Khupha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Gcina iiTheyibhile ze-Plugin xa uKhupha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its fabrics, inventory, and samples. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the inventory first from the Fabric Admin page. The fabric is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Xa ikhethiwe, ukususa iplagini kugcina iifabrikhi zayo, uluhlu lwezinto, kunye neesampuli. Yicime ukuze ukususa kuzilahle; thumela ngaphandle uluhlu kuqala kwiphepha le-Fabric Admin. Ifabrikhi ayize iqhagamshelwe nangayiphi na indlela."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory must be an absolute path of letters, digits, dots, dashes, underscores, and slashes, with no trailing slash."
msgstr "Uvimba wezixhobo kufuneka abe yindlela epheleleyo yoonobumba, amanani, amachaphaza, iidashi, ii-underscore, kunye neesleshi, ngaphandle kwesleshi ekugqibeleni."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory does not exist or is not a directory."
msgstr "Uvimba wezixhobo akakho okanye akangovimba."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory path contains a symbolic link. Enter the real path."
msgstr "Indlela yovimba wezixhobo iqulethe ikhonkco eliyisimboli. Ngenisa indlela yokwenene."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory is not owned by root."
msgstr "Uvimba wezixhobo akayowaka-root."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory can be written by its group or by others."
msgstr "Uvimba wezixhobo unokubhalwa liqela lakhe okanye ngabanye."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool is not owned by root."
msgstr "Isixhobo soxilongo asiyosika-root."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool can be written by its group or by others."
msgstr "Isixhobo soxilongo sinokubhalwa liqela laso okanye ngabanye."

